# Academic Records Blockchain — Complete Project Documentation

## 1. Project Overview

A **Hyperledger Fabric** blockchain-based system for managing academic records at **NIT Warangal**. It provides tamper-proof storage of student records, certificates, and academic transcripts with role-based access control across university departments.

---

## 2. Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| **Blockchain** | Hyperledger Fabric 2.5 (permissioned blockchain) |
| **Smart Contract** | Go (`fabric-contract-api-go`) — [chaincode.go](file:///home/aditi/workspace/Academic_RecordsBlockchain/chaincode-go/chaincode.go) (3769 lines) |
| **Ordering** | EtcdRaft (crash fault tolerant consensus) |
| **State DB** | CouchDB 3.3 (rich queries on world state) |
| **Backend API** | Node.js + Express.js with `fabric-network` SDK |
| **Frontend** | Angular 17 + Angular Material (standalone components) |
| **Auth** | JWT tokens (bcrypt password hashing) |
| **Certificates** | Fabric CA (Certificate Authority) per org |
| **Containerization** | Docker Compose |
| **PDF Generation** | jsPDF (client-side grade sheets & certificates) |

---

## 3. Network Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Docker Network: fabric_nitw"
        subgraph "Orderer"
            O["orderer.nitw.edu:7050<br/>EtcdRaft<br/>OrdererMSP"]
        end

        subgraph "Org 1: NIT Warangal (Admin)"
            CA1["ca-nitwarangal:8054"]
            P1["peer0.nitwarangal:7051<br/>NITWarangalMSP"]
            DB1["couchdb0:5984"]
            P1 --> DB1
        end

        subgraph "Org 2: Departments"
            CA2["ca-departments:9054"]
            P2["peer0.departments:9051<br/>DepartmentsMSP"]
            DB2["couchdb1:6984"]
            P2 --> DB2
        end

        subgraph "Org 3: Verifiers"
            CA3["ca-verifiers:11054"]
            P3["peer0.verifiers:11051<br/>VerifiersMSP"]
            DB3["couchdb2:7984"]
            P3 --> DB3
        end

        O --> P1
        O --> P2
        O --> P3
    end

    subgraph "Application Layer"
        BE["Node.js Backend :3000"]
        FE["Angular Frontend :4200"]
        FE --> BE
        BE --> P1
    end
```

### Three Organizations (Peers)

| Org | MSP ID | Role | Peers | CA Port |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **NIT Warangal** | `NITWarangalMSP` | Central admin, registrar, student records | 2 peers (7051) | 8054 |
| **Departments** | `DepartmentsMSP` | HODs, dept-level access control | 2 peers (9051) | 9054 |
| **Verifiers** | `VerifiersMSP` | External verification (employers, other universities) | 1 peer (11051) | 11054 |

### Channel
- **Name:** `academic-records-channel`
- **Chaincode:** `academic-records`
- All 3 orgs are members of this channel

### Consensus
- **EtcdRaft** — single orderer node (`orderer.nitw.edu:7050`)
- Batch timeout: 2s, max 10 messages per block

