## 4. Smart Contract (Chaincode)

Written in **Go** — [chaincode.go](file:///home/aditi/workspace/Academic_RecordsBlockchain/chaincode-go/chaincode.go)

### Data Models (stored on blockchain ledger)

| Model | Key Fields | Stored In |
|---|---|---|
| **Student** | rollNumber, name, department, enrollmentYear, email, status, CGPA | World State (public) |
| **StudentPrivateDetails** | phone, personalEmail, aadhaarHash | Private Data Collection |
| **Department** | departmentId, departmentName, HOD, email | World State |
| **AcademicRecord** | recordId, studentId, semester, courses[], SGPA, CGPA, status | World State |
| **Certificate** | certificateId, studentId, type, pdfHash, ipfsHash, verified, revoked | World State |
| **CourseOffering** | offeringId, courseCode, credits, semester, academicYear | World State |

### Key Chaincode Functions

| Function | Who Can Call | What It Does |
|---|---|---|
| [CreateStudent](file:///home/aditi/workspace/Academic_RecordsBlockchain/chaincode-go/chaincode.go#320-498) | NITWarangalMSP | Creates student with public + private data |
| [GetStudent](file:///home/aditi/workspace/Academic_RecordsBlockchain/chaincode-go/chaincode.go#524-542) | Any org | Reads public student record |
| [GetStudentPrivateDetails](file:///home/aditi/workspace/Academic_RecordsBlockchain/chaincode-go/chaincode.go#499-523) | NITWarangalMSP only | Reads Aadhaar hash, phone, personal email |
| [UpdateStudentStatus](file:///home/aditi/workspace/Academic_RecordsBlockchain/chaincode-go/chaincode.go#543-633) | NITWarangalMSP | Change status (ACTIVE→GRADUATED etc.) |
| [CreateDepartment](file:///home/aditi/workspace/Academic_RecordsBlockchain/chaincode-go/chaincode.go#2179-2245) | NITWarangalMSP | Register a department |
| `SubmitAcademicRecord` | NITWarangalMSP, DepartmentsMSP | Submit semester grades for a student |
| [ApproveAcademicRecord](file:///home/aditi/workspace/Academic_RecordsBlockchain/chaincode-go/chaincode.go#1033-1157) | NITWarangalMSP | Admin approves submitted grades |
| [IssueCertificate](file:///home/aditi/workspace/Academic_RecordsBlockchain/chaincode-go/chaincode.go#1158-1284) | NITWarangalMSP | Issue degree/transcript/bonafide certificate |
| [VerifyCertificate](file:///home/aditi/workspace/Academic_RecordsBlockchain/chaincode-go/chaincode.go#1321-1364) | Any org (including VerifiersMSP) | Verify a certificate's authenticity |
| [RevokeCertificate](file:///home/aditi/workspace/Academic_RecordsBlockchain/chaincode-go/chaincode.go#1365-1445) | NITWarangalMSP | Revoke a previously issued certificate |
| [GetStudentHistory](file:///home/aditi/workspace/Academic_RecordsBlockchain/chaincode-go/chaincode.go#1504-1552) | Any org | Full audit trail of a student record |

### Access Control (RBAC via MSP)

```
NITWarangalMSP  → Full access (create, update, delete, approve)
DepartmentsMSP  → Department-scoped access (submit records, view dept students)
VerifiersMSP    → Read-only verification access
```

### Private Data
- Sensitive student info (Aadhaar hash, personal phone/email) stored in **private data collection** (`studentPrivateCollection`)
- Only `NITWarangalMSP` can read private data
- Passed via **transient data** (never written to blockchain transaction log)

### Grading System (10-point scale)

| Grade | Points | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| S | 10 | Outstanding |
| A | 9 | Excellent |
| B | 8 | Very Good |
| C | 7 | Good |
| D | 6 | Satisfactory |
| P | 5 | Pass |
| U | 0 | Fail |
| R | 0 | Repeat (attendance shortage) |

