## 6. Frontend Architecture

**Angular 17** with standalone components and Angular Material

### Feature Modules

| Module | Route | Who Uses It |
|---|---|---|
| Login | `/login` | Everyone |
| Admin Dashboard | `/admin` | `admin` role — manages students, departments, courses, users, cert approvals |
| Faculty Dashboard | `/faculty` | [faculty](file:///home/aditi/workspace/Academic-Records-Blockchain-Frontend/src/app/core/services/blockchain.service.ts#158-161), `exam_section`, [hod](file:///home/aditi/workspace%20%28copy%29/Academic-Records-Blockchain-Backend/src/controllers/approvalController.js#91-116), `dac_member`, `dean_academic` |
| Department Dashboard | `/department/:id` | [department](file:///home/aditi/workspace/Academic_RecordsBlockchain/chaincode-go/chaincode.go#2358-2369) role (HOD login) — students, courses, cert approvals |
| Student Profile | `/student/:roll` | `student` role — view marks, certificates, grade sheets |
| Verify Certificate | `/verify` | Public — verify certificate authenticity via blockchain |

### Key Pages

- **Student Profile** — 4 tabs: My Info, Courses & Marks, Grade Sheets (expandable per-semester with SGPA + PDF download), Certificates
- **Faculty Dashboard** — 3 tabs: My Courses, Verify Marks (exam_section only), Upload Marks (all faculty)
- **Department Dashboard** — 4 tabs: Overview stats, Students, Courses, Cert Approvals
- **Admin Dashboard** — 6 tabs: Overview, Students, Cert Approvals, Departments, Courses, Users

---

## 7. User Roles & Permissions

| Role | Users | What They Can Do |
|---|---|---|
| **admin** | `admin` | Full access — create students/departments (blockchain), manage users, approve certs, view all data |
| **student** | `25CSM2R26`, `CS21B001`, etc. | View own profile, marks, certificates, request certificates, download grade sheets |
| **faculty** | `faculty_demo`, `faculty_demo_2` | View assigned courses, **upload marks** for students, view course student list |
| **hod** | `hod_demo` | All faculty permissions + view department scope |
| **department** | `CSE`, `MECH` | Department dashboard, view dept students/courses, **approve/reject certificate requests** |
| **exam_section** | `exam_section_demo` | **Verify marks** uploaded by faculty, view all pending marks |
| **dac_member** | `dac_member_1`, `dac_member_2` | DAC committee member — approve certificates |
| **dean_academic** | `dean_academic_demo` | Dean oversight |

